{"id": "72112", "title": "花千骨", "author": "Fresh果果", "category": "玄幻魔法", "count": 147, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/72/72112/72112s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/72/72112.htm", "intro": ";“这世上我最怕两样东西，鬼和师父……”\r\n    “姐姐，你好高好漂亮啊，唯一的缺点就是胸小了点……”\r\n    “这些舌头都很听话，有时候也会需要浇浇水，有时候也需要把天顶打开，让它们晒晒太阳。”\r\n    “什么叫离她远一点，笑话！我要天下皆在我手，还怕逆不了这小小乾坤！”\r\n    “没有喜欢也没有不喜欢。所以，不管以怎样一种方式活着，对于我来说，都是无关紧要的事情。”", "base": "files/article/html/72/72112", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1.水鬼拦路", "file": "11396416.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2.萝卜排队", "file": "11396417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3.舌头开会", "file": "11396418.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4.七星迷阵", "file": "11396419.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5.当时年少", "file": "11396420.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6.茅山求道", "file": "11396421.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7.不期而遇", "file": "11396422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8.惊天大秘", "file": "11396423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9.糖宝出世", "file": "11396424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10.昆仑瑶池", "file": "11396425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11.群仙之宴", "file": "11396426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12.长留上仙", "file": "11396427.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13.一年之约", "file": "11396428.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14.长留仙山", "file": "11396429.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15.三生池水", "file": "11396430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16.神仙学校", "file": "11396431.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17.上古神器", "file": "11396432.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18.六界全书", "file": "11396433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19.御剑而飞", "file": "11396434.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20.只争朝夕", "file": "11396435.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21.月夜焚香", "file": "11396436.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22.茅山掌门", "file": "11396437.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23.流火绯瞳", 